      "uid": "zhcn:f6351d1935ded95ed5d6b3ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一句话都没说，她却不知为何选择了我……\n虽然不知道原因是什么，不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b47172a88af327ada03cf280b14cb0a7917a8b74a10c56087b8a72087be8641",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
