    {
      "uid": "zhcn:415999c258645f5a078d9e2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回想起她那威风凛凛的跑法，能够负责训练\n如此厉害的赛马娘，只能说是身为训练员最大的荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "231bf6bf4e089def5866249545078d5347ba530fdfc2f0e090b42e3059dccb5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
