      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过──这股气势立刻就熄灭了。\n隔天，我干劲十足地拟定了训练项目，但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "419c70fe68b57d38673e741ab8a02ae317491e07e208c796ba633e31f839b22b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
